window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>USA Today </i>best-selling YA and paranormal author W.J. May takes you along a journey of finding oneself, finding one's strengths and weaknesses, and of knowing who to trust and how far one is willing to go.</p> <p><b>Your curse is your biggest strength. I just didn't know it yet.</b></p> <p>Jamie Hunt's the high school quarterback in his senior year. He's popular, smart, and got the prettiest girl in the school chasing him. Everything couldn't be more perfect. </p> <p>But a single mistake changes everything. His new \"ability\" puts him in the middle of a war he doesn't want to be a part of, protecting a girl he barely knows and running from the one thing he loves - his family.</p> <p>Never give up. Never give in. </p> <p><b><i>Lost Souls</i></b><b> is the first book in Mending Magic series.</b></p>"; 
